- The genotypes of all individuals in the population are determined (see chart) and used to determine the actual allele frequencies in the population.
- Refer to the figure above. Is this population in Hardy-Weinberg equilibrium?
  - A) Yes.
  - B) No; there are [more heterozygotes]{color=#EC9BA4} than expected.
  - C) No; there are [more homozygotes]{color=red} than expected.
  - D) More information is needed to answer this question.

